# Website grounding rules

- Company doctrine lives in private `Axon-Enjin/company-docs`.
- For customer-facing copy and IA, read only `docs/grounding/` — especially `WEBSITE-CONTRACT.md` and `COMMERCIAL-MODEL-V2.md`.
- Never invent prices, compliance claims, or payment acceptance.
- No peso/currency amounts on the public site (F-34).
- Ventures are secondary (footer / About only).
- If grounding conflicts with live HTML, flag it — do not silently invent a third doctrine.
- Do not treat `docs/_retired-to-company-docs/` as source of truth.
